# GraphLife

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphLife } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphLife
  title="example"
  cols={44}
  rows={14}
/>
```

<div class="live">
<GraphLife
  title="example"
  cols={44}
  rows={14}
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | Caption drawn on the top edge as `[ TITLE ]`. |
| `cols?` | `number` | `44` | Columns of the board. Default 44. |
| `rows?` | `number` | `14` | Rows of the board. Default 14. |
| `density?` | `number` | `0.28` | Random fill probability when no `seed` is given. Default 0.28. |
| `seed?` | `boolean[][]` | `—` | Explicit initial board. Padded/cropped to `cols` x `rows`. |
| `seedNum?` | `number` | `7` | PRNG seed for the random board, reproducible. Default 7. |
| `speedMs?` | `number` | `220` | Milliseconds per generation. Default 220. |
| `animated?` | `boolean` | `true` | Start playing on mount. Default true. Reduced motion starts paused. |
| `showControls?` | `boolean` | `true` | Show the playback controls. Default true. |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | Character at each corner of the frame. Default "+". |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphLifeProps`

## Reduced motion

Animation is disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
